# Trial-Size Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 28), the guard's job operand. A WAR of level 20 at Windurst fame level 2:
# not offered (10021 on both talks); accepted by GM, the WAR's trade of the fork: nothing (the SMN test of the trade),
# and the talk is 10018 (the accepted arm reads no job).
char zone=Mhaura pos=30.6,-15.6,56.0 job=WAR lvl=20
fame Windurst 50
item MiniTuningForkOfLightning
login
trigger Lacia                             # UseFallback 0: the default 10021
finish
trigger Lacia                             # the script: not a SMN: the quest's nil; the default 10021
finish
quest OtherAreas.TrialSizeTrialByLightning accepted
trade Lacia MiniTuningForkOfLightning x1  # not a SMN: nothing
trigger Lacia                             # the default 10021
finish
trigger Lacia                             # the fork held: 10018
finish
